   "en": "There are three main types of tank chassis: light, medium, and heavy. These correspond to ⟦0⟧, ⟦1⟧, and ⟦2⟧ tanks, respectively, as well as their armor variants, such as ⟦3⟧, ⟦4⟧, and ⟦5⟧, and armored ⟦6⟧. New versions of these chassis can be unlocked through research. Research can also unlock some more specialized tank chassis types. Among other limitations, a chassis' type determines the largest size of turret the tank can handle, thus limiting the armaments the tank can use. This can be bypassed only by switching a design's main turret for a fixed superstructure.",
