   "en": "In tank designer you can specify the role of a design. This allows it to be used in certain armored combat support battalions or specialized support companies instead of in ordinary armored battalions. Changing the role of a design also inherently changes some of its stats, even if nothing else about the design changes. For example, a player can have two completely identical armored vehicle designs where one is designated a ⟦0⟧ and the other a ⟦1⟧, and the medium tank destroyer version of the identical design will have more hard attack and piercing just from the fact that it has been designated as such.",
